Package: financetracker
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Maintainer: Carlo La Sala <noreply@local>
Description: Personal finance manager offline
 FinanceTracker is a desktop app to track personal finances offline.
 It supports Fineco statement import, categories, dashboards and backups.
 All data stays on the local machine.
